Figcraft React

The numerical routines in src/engine/fit-polynomial.ts and
src/engine/fit-candidates.ts and the fitting decisions in
src/engine/pencil-fit.ts, src/engine/fit-cubic-source.ts and
src/engine/simplify-path.ts adapt mathematical methods from Kurbo 0.13.1
(common.rs, fit.rs and simplify.rs).
